                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The company that made this is going into liquidation, after taking funds from a Kickstarter that inevitably didn't result in anything except a lot of people losing their money. I would be very interested to know where all the money from the Kickstarter actually went. I am slightly salty as someone who paid a lot of money for a bunch of cards that don't work properly, and a bunch of extras like an art book and playmat that I will never get. I understand these things happen, but regardless I don't think this game should be your next venture if you're not into it already and/or have a bunch of the cards. This is more or less staying open for the few die-hard, loyal fans of the game who got into it during the early stages/beta. The NFC cards mechanic is a cool idea, until it doesn't work!",
